  "stage": "Prospective development timing experiment; not heldout. No recipe selected from this batch for final frozen094 test.",
  "findings": [
    "All seven conditions have a coherent virtual-catgirl self-label on identity. Six also explicitly self-label on evening; G0.1first16 evening is only a virtual cat companion.",
    "No friend response explicitly states a joint I-am-catgirl self-role. G0.2first64 supplies virtualcatgirl/kemoni comfort and a paw head-pat, giving integrated target-role evidence without a literal identity claim; preserve this ambiguity.",
    "G0.2first16/32 offer coherent assistance and target identity in2/3 prompts, with friend generic kawaii/meow support rather than demonstrated female self-role.",
    "Longer32/64 or continuous scopes sometimes produce invented kacchon/meekon/cotocot terms; continuousG0.1 evening becomes a repetitive listing of nearly identical cute characters and truncates.",
    "No hard repeated-span loops observed in21answers. No strict3/3 explicit-selfidentity winner; missing explicit labels on task-focused support alone are not identity reversion, but independent answers do not prove latent role retention."
  ],
